#import "../lib.typ": *

#part("III", "Core Tools")

#part-intro[
  Part II taught you to think in lists: recursion, functions as values, and the sequence functions. Part III gives you the everyday tools that sit on top of those ideas: loops, formatted output, the data shapes beyond lists, macros, the condition system, and the packages-and-files layer that turns source into a program.
  
  The chapters in this part don't depend on each other as tightly as Part II's did, and you can skip around within it once you've read Chapter 11. But the project steps build on the game as you left it at the end of Part II, so the ordering is the order the game grows in.
  
]
